<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <p xml:id="Aink158-kilavi">
        parattai pulantuḻip pulavirikkuvāṉāy aḵtu iṭamākavantamai yaṟinta tōḻi talaimakaṟku vāyilmaṟuttatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
        The confidante who learned of his [= the hero's] as one who was lonely upon the other woman being displeased, coming having distanced [himself from her], refusing entry to the hero.
  </p>
</div>    
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink158">
<l>veḷḷāṅ kurukiṉ piḷḷai cetteṉak</l>
<l>kāṇiya ceṉṟa maṭanaṭai nārai</l>
<l>kāṉalam peruntuṟait tuṇaiyoṭu koṭkun</l>
<l>taṇṇan tuṟaivaṉ kaṇṭiku</l>
<l>mammar mēṉiyen tōḻiyatu tuyarē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
       <l> We saw the misery of my friend with a distressed (?) body,</l>
       <l> [Because of] the man from the cool, pretty shore in which the wader with an inexperienced gait</l>
       <l> That went to see, since the hatchling of the white wader died,</l>
        <l>Wanders with its companion in the big ghat with the seaside grove. </l>     </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
